---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description={`Terms of service for ${site.name}.`}
>
  <p>
    By using the {site.name} website or booking our mobile grooming services, you agree to
    these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.
  </p>

  <h2>Services</h2>
  <p>
    We provide mobile pet grooming at your location within our service area. Grooming
    results may vary based on coat condition, behavior, and health. We reserve the right
    to refuse or stop service if a pet's safety or welfare is at risk.
  </p>

  <h2>Appointments & cancellations</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Appointments are confirmed when you receive confirmation from our team or booking system.</li>
    <li>Please provide accurate contact, address, and pet information.</li>
    <li>
      Cancellations or reschedules should be made as early as possible. Repeated late
      cancellations may affect future booking availability.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Pricing & payment</h2>
  <p>
    Published prices are starting estimates. Final pricing depends on breed, size, coat
    condition, and add-ons. Payment terms are provided at booking or at the time of
    service, as applicable.
  </p>

  <h2>Pet health & behavior</h2>
  <p>
    You agree to disclose known health issues, allergies, injuries, or aggressive behavior
    before the appointment. We may require veterinary clearance for certain conditions.
    You are responsible for ensuring pets are current on required vaccinations where
    applicable.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, {site.name} is not liable for indirect or
    incidental damages arising from use of our website or services. Our liability for any
    claim related to a grooming visit is limited to the amount paid for that visit, except
    where prohibited by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Website use</h2>
  <p>
    Website content is for general information and may change without notice. You may not
    misuse the site, attempt unauthorized access, or copy materials without permission.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to
    conflict-of-law rules.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For questions about these terms, contact{" "}
    <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or{" "}
    <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
